
---

## `.gitignore`

# @description  Git ignore rules for Ghostty config repository.
# @see          conf.d/99-local.conf — machine-local overrides, never committed.

# ── Local overrides (per-machine, never versioned) ──
conf.d/99-local.conf

# ── Editor swap / backup files ──
*.bak
*.swp
*.swo
*.tmp
*~
\#*\#

# ── OS metadata ──
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# ── IDE / tooling ──
.idea/
.vscode/
*.code-workspace
